  "title": "Making Coriolis Practical for EPC Projects with Micro Motion G‑Series",
  "summary": "Coriolis flow measurement is widely recognized as one of the most accurate and reliable technologies available, yet it has historically faced resistance in large-scale engineering and construction projects. The reasons are well known: too expensive to justify broadly and too difficult to select and standardize across a project. For many EPCs, this has meant specifying Coriolis only when no alternative existed […]",
